If a patient has an opioid-use then every clinician should advise an increased-hydration with the patient during a constipation-prevention.
If a patient has an opioid-use then every clinician should advise an increased-fiber-intake with the patient during a constipation-prevention.
If a patient has an opioid-use then every clinician should advise a maintained-or-increased-physical-activity with the patient during a constipation-prevention.
